  "description": "HyenaDNA is a long-context genomic foundation model built on the Hyena implicit long-convolution operator with single-nucleotide tokenization. This hidden onboarding manifest serves it as a DNA sequence embedding endpoint through the Forge life-science transformer wrapper (kind=dna_embedding, AutoModel + trust_remote_code, mean-pooled hidden states). Reuses the already-mirrored life-science-transformers image; no model-specific build. BIO_TORCH_DTYPE=float32 is chosen for numerical safety in the Hyena FFT convolution path. Remote code must remain reviewed before publication, and the full GPU/region matrix is pending, so the model stays hidden and non-default until probed.",
